      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Opening a new Invite+ instance and bringing in users via requesting invites from users already in the instance. That is all it took at the time, which was around 6:30-7:30EST on 07/27. When softcap limit was reached, invites would send users to a fresh instance and could not get into the map. Users locked out of the map in this way could not get into the map even after doing a full reboot of their VR. We thought it was our map, but testing on other maps came up with the same result; users being pushed to other instances. This continued to be an issue on maps that were not created by us, as well as on both NA and EU servers. It was different users being locked out every time a new instance was made, which ruled out for us that the issue was on the end of any particular user.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
