      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: The steps we took:\nOpen an Invite+ World\nSend invites until the instance softcap of 40 is reached.\nHave people be shunted to fresh instances. Users can no longer enter the original instance.\nIt was reproduceable at the time. If it is no longer reproduceable or it was only our group having this problem, then I'll update this ticket when we try to rehost the event.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
